  m_Text: An addictive game that will truly test your memory and attentiveness! You
    have to reveal the cards on the screen and remember their location, then turn
    them over and start searching for pairs. The faster and more accurately you find
    all the pairs, the more points you will earn. The levels become more and more
    difficult, new pictures are added and the number of cards increases, which makes
    the game even more exciting. Show off your memorization and logic skills in this
    addictive game
